#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Создатель Pipeline так же разрабатывает другие приложения, <a href=\"https://"
"flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> и <a href=\"https://"
"flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Чем больше публичных инстанций Piped, с тем более высокой скоростью Pipeline "
"будет загружать ваши подписки. Поэтому, рассмотрите возможность <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">хостинга Piped</a> с "
"публичным доступом."

